<body>

<div class="report-header">
    <h1>UK Retail Fuel Price Trend Analysis</h1>
    <div class="subtitle">Examining pricing patterns, market competitiveness, and retailer reporting behaviour across UK forecourts</div>
    <div class="meta">
        Data Period: {date_range_start.strftime('%d %B %Y')} – {date_range_end.strftime('%d %B %Y')} &nbsp;|&nbsp;
